</style>
</Fragment>

<!-- HERO -->
<section style="position:relative;min-height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;overflow:hidden;">
  <img src="/images/hero-panorama.webp" alt="Manitoba and Saskatchewan landscape" width="2000" height="950" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,61,92,0.55) 0%, rgba(10,61,92,0.25) 55%, rgba(10,61,92,0.45) 100%);"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;max-width:880px;padding:96px 24px 130px;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:18px;padding:7px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);">Certified professionals · Manitoba and Saskatchewan</span>
    <h1 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.015em;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px);margin:0 0 18px;text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(10,61,92,0.45);">Radon testing and mitigation for Winnipeg, Manitoba and Saskatchewan homes</h1>
    <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 30px;text-shadow:0 1px 12px rgba(10,61,92,0.5);">Prairie Radon Co connects homeowners in Winnipeg, Regina, Saskatoon and the towns around them with independent C-NRPP certified radon professionals for testing, mitigation systems and fan repairs. Call (204) 555-0173 and we'll ask about your test result first, then put you in touch with a professional who can look at the house and quote the work in writing.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="tel:+12045550173" class="btn-green" style="font-size:15px;padding:16px 38px;">Call Now — (204) 555-0173</a>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-white-outline" style="font-size:15px;">Get a No-Obligation Quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <svg class="swoosh" style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;" viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,70 C360,10 1080,10 1440,70 L1440,70 L0,70 Z" fill="#ffffff"/></svg>
</section>

<!-- INTRO -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px 64px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="intro-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div style="position:relative;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 56px rgba(10,61,92,0.22);aspect-ratio:1/1;">
        <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="Tree-lined Prairie residential street" width="1024" height="1024" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div style="position:absolute;bottom:-18px;right:-14px;background:#B7862F;color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(47,163,77,0.4);">
        <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin:0;line-height:1;">91 days</p>
        <p style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin:4px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">Test First</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Radon in Manitoba and Saskatchewan</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 18px;">Common on the Prairies, invisible, and fixable once you know the number</h2>
      <div class="rich"><p>Radon is a gas that comes up out of the soil and into basements through cracks, sump pits and gaps around pipes. You can't see it or smell it. Health Canada calls it the number one cause of lung cancer in non-smokers, and it's the second leading cause after smoking. Nobody can tell you whether your house is high without a test, and that includes us.</p><p>The first step is a <a href="/radon-testing/">long-term radon test</a> of at least three months in the lowest level you use. If the result is over 200 Bq/m3, a <a href="/radon-mitigation/">sub-slab depressurization system</a> is the usual fix. Winnipeg installers advertise systems from about $1,500 to $3,000; a Regina installer quotes $2,500 to $3,500. The <a href="/radon-mitigation-cost/">cost page</a> shows where those figures come from and what pushes a job higher.</p></div>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-blue" style="margin-top:10px;">More About Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: 44px !important; } }
</style>

<!-- TILES -->
<section id="services" style="padding:72px 24px 84px;background:#EEF2F7;">
  <div style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">Where people usually start</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 40px;">What's going on with the radon in your house?</h2>
    <div class="tile-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;">
      <a href="/radon-mitigation/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-1.webp" alt="Radon suction pipe running up a basement wall from the floor slab" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;padding:14px 12px;">Test came back over 200 Bq/m3</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/radon-testing/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-2.webp" alt="Long-term radon detector sitting on a shelf in a finished basement" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;padding:14px 12px;">Never tested the basement</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/radon-testing-home-sale/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-3.webp" alt="Prairie bungalow with a for-sale sign on the front lawn" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;padding:14px 12px;">Radon came up in a house sale</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/radon-fan-replacement/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-4.webp" alt="Radon fan mounted on a vent pipe beside a house foundation" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;padding:14px 12px;">Fan is noisy or has stopped</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/radon-manometer-reading/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-1.webp" alt="U-tube manometer on a radon pipe showing the liquid level on each side" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;padding:14px 12px;">Manometer reading looks wrong</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/radon-still-high-after-mitigation/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-2.webp" alt="Digital radon monitor on a basement table next to a mitigation pipe" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;padding:14px 12px;">Still high after mitigation</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/radon-mitigation-cost-manitoba-saskatchewan/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-3.webp" alt="Written radon mitigation quote on a kitchen table" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;padding:14px 12px;">What a system costs here</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/radon-mitigation-grants-manitoba/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-4.webp" alt="Homeowner reading radon funding information at a laptop" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;padding:14px 12px;">Grants and loans in Manitoba</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .tile-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr) !important; } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .tile-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>

<!-- SERVICE CARDS -->
<section style="padding:0 24px 80px;background:#EEF2F7;">
  <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="svc-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <a href="/radon-mitigation/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0D2;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 10px;">Radon Mitigation Systems</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Sub-slab depressurization puts a pipe through the basement floor and a fan that vents the soil gas outside, and Health Canada says it cuts radon by more than 80% in most homes. We connect you with a certified mitigation professional who looks at your slab, sump and crawl space before quoting.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B7862F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/radon-testing/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0D2;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 10px;">Radon Testing</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Health Canada's method is a long-term test of at least 91 days in the heating season, placed in the lowest level you spend time in. A kit costs $70.00 before tax from HomeRadonTest.ca, and some Prairie libraries lend screening monitors for free.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B7862F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/radon-testing-home-sale/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0D2;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 10px;">Radon Testing for Home Sales</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Buyers and sellers rarely have 91 days, so a house deal needs a plan that accounts for what a short test can and can't tell you. We explain the options and point you to your realtor or lawyer for the conditions, since we don't give legal advice.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B7862F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/radon-fan-replacement/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0D2;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 10px;">Radon Fan Replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Fans wear out, and Health Canada says the system only works if the fan runs all the time. If yours is rattling, silent or the manometer has gone flat, a professional can check it and quote the repair.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B7862F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr) !important; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>

<!-- WHY -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="why-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">What Makes Us Different</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 28px;">Straight answers on testing, systems and the costs behind them</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B7862F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 4px;">We tell you to test first</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">If you haven't done a long-term test, we'll say so before anyone quotes you a system. It slows things down, and it's the only way to know whether you need one.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B7862F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 4px;">Certification you can check yourself</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Prairie Radon Co isn't certified and doesn't test or install. The professional who quotes your job should hold C-NRPP certification, and you can look them up in C-NRPP's online directory before you sign anything.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B7862F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 4px;">Prices with a name attached</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">We publish what named Winnipeg and Regina installers advertise, and we say who said it. We won't invent a local price for a city where none has been published.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B7862F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 4px;">The money help, written out</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Lungs Matter, the Manitoba Hydro loan and the Saskatchewan renovation tax credit all have different rules, and two of them require a C-NRPP professional. We lay them out so you can check eligibility before the quote.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(10,61,92,0.2);aspect-ratio:4/5;">
        <img src="/images/hero-800.webp" alt="Prairie Radon Co at work" width="800" height="800" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;">
        <div style="background:#2E5A87;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;text-align:center;">
          <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:0;line-height:1;">91 days</p>
