<!-- PROCESS -->
<section style="padding:76px 24px;background:#EEF2F7;">
  <div style="max-width:1020px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">How It Works</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin:0 0 44px;">Three Steps: Test, Quote, Retest.</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B7862F;color:#fff;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 10px;">Call and tell us your number</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Call (204) 555-0173 with your test result, or tell us you haven't tested yet. If you haven't, we'll point you to a long-term test first; if you're over 200 Bq/m3, we'll ask about the house so the right professional gets the call.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B7862F;color:#fff;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 10px;">Site visit and scope</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">An independent certified mitigation professional looks at the basement floor, any sump pit or crawl space, and where a pipe and fan can go. That visit is what sets the scope of the job.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B7862F;color:#fff;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#16263B;margin:0 0 10px;">Written quote, install and retest</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">You get a written quote to compare, and Health Canada says a system can usually be installed in less than a day. After it's switched on, a short-term test confirms it's working, then you run a long-term test through the first heating season.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
